<title>USA: PSE to list Physicians Resource options.</title>
<headline>PSE to list Physicians Resource options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said it will list options on Physicians Resource Group Inc shares on December 16.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, with expirations in January, February, May and August, the exchange said.  It added that the underlying stock was also available at PSE.</p>
<p>Sheldon Kahn of Pax West will be the lead market-maker, PSE said. ((Derivatives Desk: 312-408-8750 / derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
